#: ../../source/jpegtran-bin_readme.md:3
msgid ""
"[libjpeg-turbo](http://libjpeg-turbo.virtualgl.org/) is a derivative of "
"libjpeg that uses SIMD instructions (MMX, SSE2, NEON) to accelerate "
"baseline JPEG compression and decompression on x86, x86-64, and ARM "
"systems. On such systems, libjpeg-turbo is generally 2-4x as fast as the "
"unmodified version of libjpeg, all else being equal."
msgstr ""

